th the majority of the main cast  and he didn't say a word but there was  something interesting that was supposed  to happen during that dragon pit scene  that they ended up cutting out of the  show but it's technically not a deleted  scene but it was in the script and for  some reason they never did it at some  point during the dragon pit scene Varys  was supposed to have a talk with one of  the little birds Varys was going to ask  one of them about Kai  burn and she says he gives them sweets  and looks after them varus was then  going to say that is good do you know  what is better than having a good friend  to good friends that scene was in the  season seven plot leak that was 99.9%  accurate so it appears as if they were  going to show varus connect with his  network again but they didn't do this  for whatever reason I guess it is  possible they introduced this during  season 8 but that's only speculation at  this point I honestly think the  showrunners have no idea what to do at  varus right now which is why he is going  to die next season  just like Melisandre said he would I  made a video about this as well it's  called the death of varus check that out  I think I made a pretty good case for  how and why varus will die next season I  will answer one more than I will end the  video for today the last question is  from Hill Babineaux what do you think  the very last scene from the sixth  episode will be about this was kind of a  tough question because there are  actually a handful of things I think  they can do as the final scene of this  series there are a few different final  scenes I have in mind that I think would  be kind of cool one of the things I  think they could do is have ice reforged  again right as the show is about to end  we could get a very similar scene of  when ice was melted down into two swords  but this time we could see the two  swords being melted down and turned back  into ice again the stark theme music  could be playing as Gendry is forging  ice again for the Starks and as he  places ice on the mantle and Winterfell  the camera can slowly zoom out and fade  to black with the music still playing  softly or the final scene could be the  Iron Throne being destroyed the Iron  Throne has been the symbol of power and  corruption for the entire story the  struggle over who sits on this throne  has nearly destroyed the realm but after  all the big wars are over and the Seven  Kingdoms are in ruins there could be a  sign of hope when this series ends even  though some of our favorite characters  will be dead there may be just enough  decent people around to give us that  dream of spring and it can start with  the iron throne being destroyed or  melted down right as the last episode is  about to fade to black we could see the  Iron Throne being broken down into pea  says more the final scene could do  something simple like the birth of the  Narus and John's child whatever it is I  am thinking it will be some sign of hope  after all that we have been through over  the course of this series I think it  needs to end with some sort of hope some  dream of spring even if 90% of the  characters are dead and all the castles  have fell just give us something that  lets us know things will be restored in  due time that's all I ask  but if you have an idea for a great  ending scene put it down in the comments  because I would love to read it once  again I want to thank everyone for  stopping by and watching this video  I always appreciate anyone willing to  take time out of their day to watch one  of my videos I hope to see you all come  back for the next one and thank you to  everyone on patreon as well who  continues to support this channel during  this long night I hope you all have a  great day I will see you in the next one  bye  [Music]  [Music]
 

